🧠 14. Don't confuse these three things
Password

Secret information the user knows.

********
Password hash

A protected representation stored in the database.

$2b$10$...
JWT/token

Authentication information used to establish that the user has successfully authenticated.

eyJhbGciOi...

For now, you only need to understand their purpose, not memorize their structure.

